{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 13, "text": "观看革命现代芭蕾舞剧《红色娘子军》后的指示（一九六四年十月八日）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n118)\n观看革命现代芭蕾舞剧《红色娘子军》后的指示\n（一九六四年十月八日）\n《红色娘子军》方向是对的，革命是成功的，艺术上也是好的。\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-e96396b550ceffcdbccc", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-118.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "370f0a2ac487748d6c59a8959d7bee8b5ec7ecda8cc211b9d1c0a06b99dda636", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "28f264abca9e295f47ee96dd5222864fd04ada9d947ff29ab4493ea53e95677d", "text_chars": 149}
